### Calc service (FastAPI) — run `fastapi dev main.py`, listens on 8000. Docs at /docs
@host = http://localhost:8000

### Health check
GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json

### Price zones — bare list of prices in, two cut-off prices out. Same route for 7 days or a year.
POST {{host}}/price-zones
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

[
  155.26, 148.90, 132.00, 121.44, 118.02, 110.35, 104.88, 99.10,
  95.42, 91.07, 88.63, 84.29, 80.15, 76.88, 71.20, 66.05,
  62.40, 58.77, 54.13, 49.90, 45.62, 38.04, 22.51, -3.18
]

### Schedule — REAL Slovakia data, 2026-07-24 (full 15-min day). Payload from the DB.
POST {{host}}/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

< ./sample-request-sk-2026-07-24.json

